{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The task is clear now. This is a FoodWagon food delivery landing page design task. Let me note the key requirements:\n\n**Task**: Design a landing page for a food delivery service (FoodWagon). Desktop web, 1920 wide, light mode. Single frame named \"01_Home\" in 03 · Workspace.\n\n**Brand colors**: #F17228 (orange) and #FFB30E (yellow/amber), typeface: Source Sans Pro.\n\n**Must include** (frame 01_Home):\n- Header: Logo_FoodWagon · \"Deliver to:\" (Icon_Map_Marker) · \"Current Location\" · \"Mohammadpur Bus Stand, Dhaka\" · \"Search Food\" (Icon_Search) · \"Login\" (Icon_User)\n- Hero: Photo_Hero_Background · Photo_Hero_Noodles · \"Are you starving?\" · \"Within a few clicks, find meals that are accessible near you\" · tabs Delivery (Icon_Motorcycle) · Pickup (Icon_Shopping_Bag) · current: Delivery · address field \"Enter Your Address\" (Icon_Map_Marker) · \"Find Food\" (Icon_Search)\n- Deals: 3 promo blocks, each with title, copy, \"Proceed to order\" (Icon_Chevron_Right) and photo (see DATA)\n- Discounts: 4 discount cards, each with photo, percent \"Off\", dish name and days remaining (see DATA)\n- Featured Restaurants: \"Featured Restaurants\" · 8 restaurant cards, each with photo, discount badge (Icon_Tag), \"Fast\" badge (Icon_Clock), logo mark with the restaurant's initials, name, rating (Icon_Star) and open status · \"View All\" (Icon_Chevron_Right)\n- Features: Daily Discounts (Icon_Discount) · Live Tracking (Icon_Tracking) · Quick Delivery (Icon_Quick_Delivery)\n- Popular items: \"Popular items\" · previous/next (Icon_Chevron_Left, Icon_Chevron_Right) · 5 item cards, each with photo, name, restaurant (Icon_Map_Marker), price and \"Order Now\"\n- Search by Food: \"Search by Food\" · \"View All\" (Icon_Chevron_Right) · previous/next (Icon_Chevron_Left, Icon_Chevron_Right) · Pizza · Burger · Noodles · Sub-sandwich · Chowmein · Steak, each with its photo\n- How it works: \"How does it work\" · 4 steps, each with icon, title and text\n- App promo: \"Install the app\" · \"It's never been easier to order food. Look for the finest discounts and you'll be lost in a world of delectable food.\" · Image_App_Mockup · Badge_App_Store · Badge_Google_Play\n- Call to action: Photo_CTA_Background · \"Are you ready to order with the best deals?\" · \"Proceed to order\" (Icon_Chevron_Right)\n- Footer: see DATA (Footer)\n\n**Data**:\n- Discounts: 15% Off · Spring Salad · 6 Days Remaining (Photo_Discount_1); 10% Off · Farfalle Salad · 6 Days Remaining (Photo_Discount_2); 25% Off · Buddha Bowl · 7 Days Remaining (Photo_Discount_3); 20% Off · Red Curry Soup · 8 Days Remaining (Photo_Discount_4)\n- How does it work: Select location (Icon_Step_Location) — Choose the location where your food will be delivered. Choose order (Icon_Step_Order) — Check over hundreds of menus to pick your favorite food. Pay advanced (Icon_Step_Payment) — It's quick, safe, and simple. Select several methods of payment. Enjoy meals (Icon_Step_Enjoy) — Food is made and delivered directly to your home.\n- Popular items: Cheese Burger · Burger Arena · $3.88 (Photo_Cheese_Burger); Toffee's Cake · Top Sticks · $4.00 (Photo_Toffee_Cake); Pancake · Cake World · $1.99 (Photo_Pancake); Crispy Sandwich · Fastfood Dine · $3.00 (Photo_Crispy_Sandwich); Thai Soup · Foody man · $2.79 (Photo_Thai_Soup)\n- Featured Restaurants (all \"Fast\"): Foodworld · 20% off · ★ 46 · Opens tomorrow (Photo_Foodworld); Pizzahub · 15% off · ★ 40 · Opens tomorrow (Photo_Pizzahub); Donuts Hut · 10% off · ★ 20 · Open Now (Photo_Donuts_Hut); Cupcake Corner · 15% off · ★ 50 · Open Now (Photo_Cupcake_Corner); Ruby Grill · 10% off · ★ 26 · Open Now (Photo_Ruby_Grill); Kuakata Fried Chicken · 25% off · ★ 53 · Open Now (Photo_Kuakata_Fried_Chicken); Red Square · 10% off · ★ 45 · Open Now (Photo_Red_Square); Taco Bay · 10% off · ★ 35 · Open Now (Photo_Taco_Bay)\n- Deals: Best deals Crispy Sandwiches — Enjoy the large size of sandwiches.