to-layout: left photo 120x160 rounded-left, right content on warm bg: \"15% Off\" (orange bold 22), \"Spring Salad\" (18 bold), \"6 Days Remaining\" (14 muted). That's clean and readable. I'll do horizontal cards.\n4. **Deals** (3 promo blocks): each 410x300 card: photo top (full-width 200h rounded), title (bold 20), copy (14, 2 lines), \"Proceed to order →\" orange link with chevron icon.\n5. **Featured Restaurants**: header row (title 28 bold + \"View All →\" orange). Grid 4x2, card 302x?): photo top (302x160 rounded-top) with badges overlaid: discount badge (tag icon + \"20% off\" pill orange) top-left, \"Fast\" badge (clock icon + \"Fast\" pill yellow) top-right. Bottom: initials mark (circle 40 with initials, colored bg), name (18 bold), rating row (star icon yellow + \"46\"), status: \"Open Now\" green / \"Opens Tomorrow\" gray.\n   Data: Foodworld · 20% off · ★46 · Opens tomorrow; Pizzahub · 15% off · ★40 · Opens tomorrow; Donuts Hut · 10% off · ★20 · Open Now; Cupcake Corner · 15% off · ★50 · Open Now; Ruby Grill · 10% off · ★26 · Open Now; Kuakata Fried Chicken · 25% off · ★53 · Open Now; Red Square · 10% off · ★45 · Open Now; Taco Bay · 10% off · ★35 · Open Now.\n   Initials: FW, PH, DH, CC, RG, KFC, RS, TB.\n6. **Features strip**: 3 items in a row, each: icon in orange-tinted circle 56, title bold 20 (\"Daily Discounts\", \"Live Tracking\", \"Quick Delivery\"). Maybe with short supporting line? The brief only requires icon + title (the Features list: Daily Discounts (Icon_Discount) · Live Tracking (Icon_Tracking) · Quick Delivery (Icon_Quick_Delivery)). I'll add short copy to make it look complete — allowed (design decision). Keep small.\n7. **Popular items**: header (title + prev/next circle buttons). Row of 5 cards (each ~232 wide): photo top rounded (232x160), name bold 16, restaurant row (map marker icon 16 + name 14 muted), price (orange bold 20) + \"Order Now\" small button (yellow pill? Original had yellow \"Order Now\" buttons). I'll make \"Order Now\" small button with yellow bg, dark text.\n8. **Search by Food**: header (title + View All + prev/next). 6 category tiles (each ~195x180): circular photo 120 with orange border, name below 16 semibold. Original FoodWagon style: circular image with orange ring.\n9. **How does it work**: 4 step cards in a row: icon in circle, title bold, copy small; connect with dashed line? Keep simple: 4 columns centered, step number badge? Brief: each with icon, title and text. I'll add number circle behind icon for hierarchy.\n10. **App promo**: dark warm panel (bg #1A1A1F? or orange gradient) with left text: \"Install the app\" H2, copy, badges App Store + Google Play; right Image_App_Mockup (254x320) sticking out top/bottom. Original: white bg with mockup on right. I'll do warm gradient panel (#F17228 → #FFB30E) radius 24, white text, mockup right overflowing. Badge components on top (they're dark badges presumably).\n11. **CTA**: full-width band with Photo_CTA_Background as background image (darkened), centered: \"Are you ready to order with the best deals?\" H2 white + \"Proceed to order\" button (yellow bg dark text? Original CTA used orange button; brief says Button default is orange #F17228; on dark bg orange works).\n12. **Footer** (dark #1A1A1F or warm dark #241C15?): Original FoodWagon footer is white with top orange? The original kit footer: dark? Let me decide: dark footer (#1F1A17 or #1A1A1F) with columns: Our top cities (2-3 column list), Company, Contact, Legal, Follow Us (social icons), newsletter: \"Receive exclusive offers in your mailbox\" + email field + Subscribe button; bottom: \"All rights Reserved © FoodWagon, 2021\" centered, divider.\n\nCities list: 24 cities. Display as multi-column (4 columns of 6) small text.\n\n**Components to create** (in workspace, e.g. left of the home frame at x=-1600 or above at y=-1200):\n- Header (component \"Header / Main Nav\")\n- HeroSearchCard\n- TabSegment (Delivery/Pickup with states via variants? Keep: \"Tab / Delive