r preamble string that I prepend in each call (functions solid, tint, mkText, etc.).\n\nGiven the 50k char limit per call and complexity, I'll split:\n\nCall A: fonts check + create all \"atom\" components: Badge/Discount, Badge/Fast, Rating, Status, InitialsMark, IconButton/Prev, IconButton/Next, Button/Primary(+Hover,Disabled variants as separate components, not variant set to keep simple—but component set is nicer; I'll create plain components with clear names to avoid set mgmt overhead... Actually component sets need CombineAsVariants. I'll create individual components named \"Button / Primary\", \"Button / Primary Hover\", etc. Fine.)\n\nCall B: Card components: DiscountCard, PromoDealCard, ItemCard, RestaurantCard, CategoryTile, StepCard, FeatureItem, HeroSearchCard(with tabs).\n\nCall C: Header component + Footer component.\n\nCall D: Assemble 01_Home: frame + header + hero + discounts + deals.\n\nCall E: assemble featured + features + popular.\n\nCall F: assemble categories + how it works + app promo + CTA + footer.\n\nCall G: screenshot & fix.\n\nFor instances placement, auto-layout everywhere simplifies. Big consideration: **use auto-layout for the page**: frame 01_Home vertical auto-layout, width 1920 fixed, hug height, itemSpacing 0; each section a full-width child. Content containers: horizontal auto-layout 1280 wide (fixed), centered via counterAxisAlignItems... For vertical page AL: child sections width 1920 (fill), each section horizontal AL with padding to center content: use primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER' with fixed width? For horizontal AL, primary axis = x; centering content with fixed container width 1280: set section width 1920, primaryAxisAlignItems 'CENTER', paddingLeft/Right 0 → content hugs centered. Yes: section AL horizontal, width 1920, primary CENTER, counter CENTER, padding vertical.\n\nHero background: hero section frame with absolute-positioned background instance (Photo_Hero_Background resized 1920x480, layoutPositioning ABSOLUTE) a