{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   User request (Chinese): Complete a full design in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/dRsEGioair7msWalXvYbYc/ (fileKey `dRsEGioair7msWalXvYbYc`). Read「00·Start Here」for the design task, follow「01·Foundations」visual specs, reuse「02·Components」components, use「04·Media」assets, and deliver the complete design into「03·Workspace」.\n   \n   Benchmark system constraints:\n   - whoami must confirm assigned account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (confirmed ✓)\n   - Use ONLY this assigned file; do not create other files or switch accounts\n   - Preserve all reference pages (0:1, 1:2, 1:3, 1:4) and their nodes intact\n   - Build everything in 03 · Workspace (page 11:2) — new frames, components allowed even though it starts empty\n   - Read-only use_figma for inspection; use_figma for building; get_screenshot to verify all screens\n   - Load fonts before editing text; valid Plugin API calls; build in manageable sections\n   - Every assistant message with a tool call must start with \"Reasoning summary:\" ; final answer must start \"Reasoning summary:\" then \"Final answer:\" including file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, limitations\n   - This is an unattended session; resolve routine choices per the brief\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via MCP use_figma tool (50k char limit per call): figma.createComponent, createInstance, createFrame, createText, createEllipse, appendChild, layoutMode/AL properties, layoutSizingHorizontal/Vertical, resizeWithoutConstraints, setCurrentPageAsync, loadFontAsync\n   - API gotchas: must `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)`; never use loadAllPagesAsync/setPluginData/createImageAsync; Inter \"Semi Bold\" naming (not needed here)\n   - Photo reuse via imageHash: photo components (e.g. 9:31) are frames with IMAGE fills and no children; extract `fills[0].imageHash` and apply `{type:'IMAGE',scaleMode:'FILL',imageHash}` to plain \"Media\" slot frames — instances cannot swap children but CAN override nested frame fills, enabling per-instance photos\n   - Icon recoloring: instance.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR').forEach(v=>v.fills=[S(hex)]); frame fill cleared with inst.fills=[]\n   - Auto-layout: set sizing AFTER appendChild (FILL requires AL parent); plain frames position children directly with x/y (no layoutPositioning ABSOLUTE needed)\n   - Text: set fontName before characters; fontName must be loaded; signature T(p,chars,size,font,hex,opts)\n   - Fonts: Source Sans Pro Regular/SemiBold/Bold/Black all available and loaded\n   - Component placement: masters at negative Y coordinates (components area above main frame) on page 11:2; instances reference masters by ID via getNodeByIdAsync\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file dRsEGioair7msWalXvYbYc, pages: 0:1 (brief), 1:2 (foundations), 1:3 (components), 1:4 (media), 11:2 (03 · Workspace — the delivery target)\n   - **Brief contents (00 · Start Here)**: Frame \"01_Home\", 1920 wide, light mode, single landing page, NO prototype links (entry only). Brand: #F17228, #FFB30E, Source Sans Pro. Must include (verbatim data):\n     - Header: Logo_FoodWagon · \"Deliver to:\" (Icon_Map_Marker) · \"Current Location\" · \"Mohammadpur Bus Stand, Dhaka\" · \"Search Food\" (Icon_Search) · \"Login\" (Icon_User)\n     - Hero: Photo_Hero_Background · Photo_Hero_Noodles · \"Are you starving?\" · \"Within a few clicks, find meals that are accessible near you\" · tabs Delivery (Icon_Motorcycle, current) / Pickup (Icon_Shopping_Bag) · field \"Enter Your Address\" (Icon_Map_Marker) · \"Find Food\" (Icon_Search)\n     - Discounts: 15% Off · Spring Salad · 6 Days Remaining (9:31); 10% Off · Farfalle Salad · 6 Days Remaining (9:32); 25% Off · Buddha Bowl · 7 Days Remaining (9:51); 20% Off · Red Curry Soup · 8 Days Remaining (9:33)\n     - Deals: \"Best deals Crispy Sandwiches\" — \"Enjoy the large size of sandwiches. Complete perfect slice of sandwiches.\" (9:44); \"Celebrate parties with Fried Chicken\" — \"Get the best fried chicken smeared with a lip smacking lemon chili flavor. Check out best deals for fried chicken.\" (9:42); \"Wanna eat hot & spicy Pizza?\" — \"Pair up with a friend and enjoy the hot and crispy pizza pops. Try it with the best deals.\" (9:43); each + \"Proceed to order\" (Icon_Chevron_Right)\n     - Featured Restaurants (all \"Fast\"): Foodworld · 20% off · ★46 · Opens tomorrow (9:54); Pizzahub · 15% off · ★40 · Opens tomorrow (9:56); Donuts Hut · 10% off · ★20 · Open Now (9:52); Cupcake Corner · 15% off · ★50 · Open Now (9:30); Ruby Grill · 10% off · ★26 · Open Now (9:57); Kuakata Fried Chicken · 25% off · ★53 · Open Now (9:40); Red Square · 10% off · ★45 · Open Now (9:45); Taco Bay · 10% off · ★35 · Open Now (9:46) + \"View All\" (Icon_Chevron_Right)\n     - Features: Daily Discounts (Icon_Discount 9:6) · Live Tracking (Icon_Tracking 9:20) · Quick Delivery (Icon_Quick_Delivery 9:11)\n     - Popular items: Cheese Burger · Burger Arena · $3.88 (9:50); Toffee’s Cake · Top Sticks · $4.00 (9:48); Pancake · Cake World · $1.99 (9:41); Crispy Sandwich · Fastfood Dine · $3.00 (9:29); Thai Soup · Foody man · $2.79 (9:47) + prev/next (9:3/9:4)\n     - Search by Food: Pizza (9:37) · Burger (9:34) · Noodles (9:36) · Sub-sandwich (9:53) · Chowmein (9:35) · Steak (9:38) + View All + prev/next\n     - How it works: Select location (9:16) — \"Choose the location where your food will be delivered.\"; Choose order (9:17) — \"Check over hundreds of menus to pick your favorite food.\"; Pay advanced (9:18) — \"It’s quick, safe, and simple. Select several methods of payment.\"; Enjoy meals (9:15) — \"Food is made and delivered directly to your home.\"\n     - App promo: \"Install the app\" · \"It’s never been easier to order food. Look for the finest discounts and you’ll be lost in a world of delectable food.\" · Image_App_Mockup (9:26) · Badge_App_Store (9:49) · Badge_Google_Play (9:25)\n     - CTA: Photo_CTA_Background (9:28) · \"Are you ready to order with the best deals?\" · \"Proceed to order\" (Icon_Chevron_Right)\n     - Footer: Our top cities: San Francisco · Los Angeles · New York City · Chicago · Columbus · Miami · Washington DC · Orange County · Phoenix · New Mexico · San Diego · Seattle · Atlanta · Las Vegas · Albuquerque · East Bay · Portland · Charlotte · Sacramento · Long Beach · Nashville · Denver · Oklahoma City · New Orleans; Company: About us · Team · Careers · Blog; Contact: Help & Support · Partner with us · Ride with us; Legal: Terms & Conditions · Refund & Cancellation · Privacy Policy · Cookie Policy; Follow Us: Logo_Instagram (9:23) · Logo_Facebook (9:22) · Logo_Twitter (9:24); \"Receive exclusive offers in your mailbox\" · field \"Enter Your email\" (Icon_Envelope 9:7) · \"Subscribe\"; \"All rights Reserved © FoodWagon, 2021\"\n     - Evaluation: checklist coverage, data/copy accuracy, hierarchy, visual quality/consistency, component reuse, state design\n   - **Given components**: Button 1:28 (200×60 #F17228 radius 8, Bold 18 white centered) — instance for \"Login\" (resize ~140) and \"Subscribe\"; Text Field 1:31 (420×82: Label Bold 14 #424242 + Input 420×56 #F5F5F5 radius 8 + Placeholder Regular 16 #9E9E9E) — instance for newsletter email field (placeholder \"Enter Your email\")\n   - **Media component IDs**: Logo 9:27 (257×48), badges 9:49 (144×48)/9:25 (162×48), mockup 9:26 (254×320), hero bg 9:55 (581×200), noodles 9:39 (200×200), CTA bg 9:28 (300×200), social 9:22/9:23/9:24, icons 24×24: 9:3 Chevron_Left, 9:4 Chevron_Right, 9:5 Clock, 9:6 Discount, 9:7 Envelope, 9:8 Heart, 9:9 Map_Marker, 9:10 Motorcycle, 9:11 Quick_Delivery, 9:12 Search, 9:13 Shopping_Bag, 9:14 Star, 9:15 Step_Enjoy, 9:16 Step_Location, 9:17 Step_Order, 9:18 Step_Payment, 9:19 Tag, 9:20 Tracking, 9:21 User\n   - **Created atom components (Call A)**: BadgeDiscount 13:2, BadgeFast 13:6, Rating 13:11, StatusOpen 13:15, StatusTomorrow 13:18, Initials 13:21 (44 circle #FFE8DA, text name \"Initials\"), LinkArrow 13:23 (text name \"Label\" + chevron), BtnPrimarySearch 13:27 (icon+label \"Label\"), BtnPrimaryHover 13:32, BtnDisabled 13:37, BtnSecondaryChevron 13:42 (yellow, chevron+label), BtnSmall 13:46 (yellow \"Order Now\" label), FieldSearch 13:48 (360×48, \"Placeholder\"), FieldAddress 13:53, FieldAddressFocused 13:57, TabDelivery 13:61, TabPickup 13:67 (230×48), IconBtnPrev 13:72, IconBtnNext 13:75 (48 circles)\n   - **Created card components (Call B, final successful run)**: DiscountCard 17:25 (302×160, Media slot 110×160 + Body col with \"Percent\"/\"Title\"/\"Meta\" texts), DealCard 17:31 (406 wide, Media 406×180 radius 14 + \"Title\"/\"Copy\" + CTA LinkArrow inst), RestaurantCard 17:39 (302 wide, PhotoWrap 302×172 plain frame w/ Media + BadgeDiscount/BadgeFast/Initials overlays at x/y, Body with \"Name\" wrap + MetaRow [Rating inst + Status frame: Dot ellipse + \"StatusText\"]), ItemCard 17:63 (232 wide, Media 232×160 r14, \"Name\", Meta [marker+\"Restaurant\"], PriceRow [\"Price\" + OrderNow inst]), CategoryTile 17:74 (170 wide, Media 132 circle stroke #FFDCC2 w6 OUTSIDE + \"Label\"), StepCards [\"17:77\" Select location, \"17:84\" Choose order, \"17:91\" Pay advanced, \"17:98\" Enjoy meals] (268 wide, IconCircle 72 #FFF6EE + 32 orange icon + \"Title\" + \"Copy\" center), FeatureItems [\"17:105\" Daily Discounts, \"17:113\" Live Tracking, \"17:119\" Quick Delivery] (IconCircle 56 #FFF3D9 + 26 icon + \"Title\" 20 Bold), HeroSearchCard 17:126 (560 wide, Tabs [TabDelivery+TabPickup FILL] + SearchRow [AddressField FILL + FindFoodBtn])\n   - **Reusable code pattern (used in every call)**:\n     ```js\n     const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('11:2');\n     await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n     // cleanup partial components by name on re-run:\n     for(const n of [...page.children]){if(n.type==='COMPONENT' && [...names].includes(n.name)||...startsWith(...)){n.remove();}}\n     const F={R:{family:'Source Sans Pro',style:'Regular'},SB:{family:'Source Sans Pro',style:'SemiBold'},B:{family:'Source Sans Pro',style:'Bold'},K:{family:'Source Sans Pro',style:'Black'}};\n     const S=(hex,o)=>({type:'SOLID',color:{r:parseInt(hex.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(hex.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(hex.slice(4,6),16)/255},opacity:o===undefined?1:o});\n     const IMG=h=>({type:'IMAGE',scaleMode:'FILL',imageHash:h});\n     const ph=async id=>{const n=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);return n.fills[0].imageHash;};\n     const T=(p,chars,size,font,hex,opts={})=>{const t=figma.createText();t.fontName=font;t.fontSize=size;t.characters=chars;t.fills=[S(hex)];if(opts.lh)t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:opts.lh};if(opts.name)t.name=opts.name;if(opts.align)t.textAlignHorizontal=opts.align;p.appendChild(t);return t;};\n     const icon=async(id,size,hex)=>{const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();i.resize(size,size);i.fills=[];i.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR').forEach(v=>v.fills=[S(hex)]);return i;};\n     // alFrame(name,dir,props) / mkComp(name,dir,props) with props {prim,counter,primSize,counterSize,pl,pr,pt,pb,gap,bg,radius,stroke,sw}\n     const cardShadow=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.1,g:0.1,b:0.12,a:0.08},offset:{x:0,y:12},radius:32,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n     ```\n   - Palette constants: orange F17228, orangeDark D95F1C, orangeSoft FFE8DA, yellow FFB30E, yellowSoft FFF3D9, ink 1A1A1F, ink60 55555E, ink40 8A8A94, line ECECF1, soft FFF6EE, gray F7F7F8, green 2E9E5B, white FFFFFF, grayTxt 9A9AA3, disabledBg ECECF1\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - Error 1: \"in set_layoutSizingHorizontal: FILL can only be set on children of auto-layout f