ght via counter AUTO — instances created from master with counterAxisSizingMode AUTO (vertical) → height hugs automatically. Good.\n\nAlso HeroSearchCard in hero: instance placed at 560 wide? Instance of 17:126 — I placed sc at x=320,y=230 without resizing; master 230 wide → instance 230 wide. After fixing master to 560, instance becomes 560. \n\nAlso hero: H1 \"Are you starving?\" — I set T then `home.findOne(n=>n.name==='H1').y=96` — findOne searches entire home subtree; H1 is in hero; setting y=96 relative to hero — fine. Subtitle at y=170, card y=230.\n\nAlso the noodles ellipse looks good. Hero bg is yellow gradient (the actual 9:55 image is a yellow/orange gradient banner) — fine, matches brand.\n\nFooter needs check after fixes. Also App promo mockup fine. CTA fine.\n\nAdditional issues spotted in screenshot:\n1. Discount card body: text left aligned tight against media with small gap — acceptable. Actually looks like media 110 + body; percent orange, title ink, meta gray — good.\n2. Restaurants: badges show \"20% off\" — brief says \"20% off\" ✓. BadgeFast shows \"Fast\" ✓. Initials circles not visible in screenshot — maybe behind photo bottom-right? They're at PhotoWrap; I positioned them... in Call B: \"BadgeDiscount/BadgeFast/Initials overlays at x/y\". Can't see initials — maybe they're positioned off-photo or white text on white. After hug fix, re-screenshot and check.\n3. Popular items prev/next buttons: visible ✓.\n4. Search by food: circles with stroke ✓ labels missing (will appear after hug fix).\n5. How does it work: titles visible, copy missing → hug fix.\n6. Features row: icon + title visible ✓.\n\nFix plan (one call):\n- For ids [17:31,17:39,17:63,17:74,17:77,17:84,17:91,17:98,17:126]: n.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'.\n- 17:126: also resize width to 560: it's vertical AL, counter FIXED → n.resizeWithoutConstraints(560, n.height) then prim AUTO recompute. Order: set counter FIXED, resize(560,10), then prim AUTO. Actually current counter=FIXED already; resizeWithoutConstraints(560,100); then primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'.\n- Also ensure Tabs/SearchRow inside 17:126 have layoutSizingHorizontal FILL (they were created with FILL? They show 182 wide = stale). After master width 560 with padding 24 → inner width 512; Tabs FILL → 512.\n- Check Tab instances inside Tabs have FILL: currently 86 each — they were set FILL at creation? Summary says \"Tabs [TabDelivery+TabPickup FILL]\". They shrank due to stale width. After resize they'll expand.\n- AddressField FILL + FindFoodBtn fixed: SearchRow 512 → field ~344, btn 156. Good.\n\nThen re-screenshot home.","signature":"4f1ad1abcf314575ad3b9a6c"}],"id":"515d2a51-0a2a-45aa-ac50-0c8fd367328c","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0cf375fe-7995-4021-9e71-e24c776e8096","uuid":"62acd3f5-ee77-4159-a353-13f1b47939cc","timestamp":"2026-11-02T00:44:27.628Z","thinking_duration_ms":44743}
